This OS has no artifacts yet. Add JSON files under data/artifacts/mobile/{category}/
matching the schema used by any file under data/artifacts/windows/ (14 fields:
id, name, type, os_min, location, purpose, key_fields, normal_baseline,
anomalies, parsing_tools, attack_techniques, anti_forensic_notes,
interpretation, related_artifacts), then regenerate data/os/mobile.json.
Category names are platform-specific, don't reuse the Windows category set here.
